  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Central Hidroelctrica de Tocoma</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Tocoma Hydroelectric Power Plant</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">El proyecto busca contribuir a la satisfaccin del crecimiento de la demanda de electricidad del pas utilizando los recursos hidralicos del Ro Caron y sustituir generacin trmica para liberar recursos no renovables.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project is aimed at satisfying the increasing demand of electricity in the country utilizing the hydraulic resources of the Caron river and substituting the thermo electric generation to decrease the use of non renewable resources.</narrative>
  </description>
